  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/664/664-11.htm",
  "statuteText": "664:11 Public Inspection. –\n\nAll statements and registrations filed by candidates and political committees shall be open to public inspection. Such statements and registrations shall be published on the website of the secretary of state."
